<!DOCTYPE PLUGIN [
<!ENTITY name "msf">
<!ENTITY author "luochuhan">
<!ENTITY version "0.4.7.4">
<!ENTITY githubRepo "scoltzero/msf">
<!ENTITY releaseTag "v0.4.7.4">
<!ENTITY packageName "msf-0.4.7.4-x86_64-1">
<!ENTITY packageFile "&packageName;.txz">
<!ENTITY packageURL "https://github.com/&githubRepo;/releases/download/&releaseTag;/&packageFile;">
<!ENTITY packageSHA256 "df9a3c2e500d846a648c1cf3e6c93f837398250a425b8827daa980054e72dce5">
]>
<PLUGIN name="&name;" author="&author;" version="&version;" pluginURL="https://github.com/&githubRepo;/releases/latest/download/msf.plg" launch="Utilities/&name;" support="https://forums.unraid.net/topic/200222-plugin-msf-mosdns-and-mihomo-management/" icon="network-wired" min="6.12.0">
  <CHANGES>
    <![CDATA[
### msf 0.4.7.4

#### Unraid Community Applications 模板修复

- 修复 CA 插件 XML 模板的 `PluginURL` 与发布版 `.plg` 内 `pluginURL` 不一致的问题；两者现在统一使用 `releases/latest/download/msf.plg`，避免插件被 CA 自动列入 blacklist。
- 将 Unraid 插件清单、CA 插件与 Docker 模板以及仓库 Profile 的 Support 入口统一为已公开的 MSF Plugin Support 主题，方便 Unraid 用户集中提交安装、兼容性和使用问题；GitHub Issues 继续用于项目缺陷跟踪。

    ]]>
  </CHANGES>

  <FILE Name="/boot/config/plugins/&name;/&packageFile;" Run="upgradepkg --install-new --reinstall">
    <URL>&packageURL;</URL>
    <SHA256>&packageSHA256;</SHA256>
  </FILE>

  <FILE Run="/bin/bash">
    <INLINE>
      <![CDATA[
set -e
mkdir -p /boot/config/plugins/msf
cfg="/boot/config/plugins/msf/msf.cfg"
if [ ! -f "$cfg" ]; then
  cat > "$cfg" <<'CFGEOF'
ENABLED="yes"
HOST="0.0.0.0"
PORT="7777"
DATA_DIR="/mnt/user/appdata/msf"
CFGEOF
fi
chmod 0755 /etc/rc.d/rc.msf 2>/dev/null || true
chmod 0755 /usr/local/emhttp/plugins/msf/event/started 2>/dev/null || true
chmod 0755 /usr/local/emhttp/plugins/msf/event/stopping_svcs 2>/dev/null || true
if grep -q '^ENABLED="yes"' "$cfg" && [ -x /etc/rc.d/rc.msf ]; then
  nohup /etc/rc.d/rc.msf start >/dev/null 2>&1 &
fi
      ]]>
    </INLINE>
  </FILE>

  <FILE Run="/bin/bash" Method="remove">
    <INLINE>
      <![CDATA[
set +e
if [ -x /etc/rc.d/rc.msf ]; then
  /etc/rc.d/rc.msf stop
fi
removepkg msf-0.4.7.4-x86_64-1
rm -f /boot/config/plugins/msf/msf-0.4.7.4-x86_64-1.txz
echo "msf plugin removed. Persistent data remains under /mnt/user/appdata/msf unless you delete it manually."
      ]]>
    </INLINE>
  </FILE>
</PLUGIN>
